      "id": "blk_8d4d440fed",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Builds the system prompt: identity, environment (project root, OS), the tool inventory, eight behavioral rules, optional project instructions from .xtracsys.md/AGENTS.md (v3, \u00a7Project instructions), and optional global extras from Settings. Rules mandate set_plan for 3+ step tasks, edit_file over write_file for surgical changes, and project-root containment."
    },
